  "numbering": "Contacts are first collected in author numbering, then converted to UniProt numbering through RCSB's own SIFTS-derived alignment (/core/uniprot/{entry}/{entity}, aligned_regions: uniprot_pos = ref_beg + label_seq - entity_beg) combined with the label_seq_id -> auth_seq_id table read out of the same coordinate file. Residues outside any aligned region (expression tags, engineered linkers, unmodelled loops) carry uniprot_pos = null and are kept, flagged."
